sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Guest
    participant C as apps/customer
    participant M as Maya
    participant S as @veent/core
    participant R as MikroTik

    G->>C: buy tier (top-up action)
    C->>M: create checkout
    M-->>G: hosted payment page
    M->>C: webhook to handlePaymentWebhook
    C->>S: creditCheckoutIfUnsettled
    Note over S: atomic claim - one settle per checkout
    S->>S: addCreditsTx + earnPointsTx
    C->>S: recordPaymentTransaction
    Note over S: externalTransactionId is the idempotency key
    G->>C: browser returns to ORIGIN
    C->>S: startPaidAccessAndBindDevice
    S->>R: NetworkController.grant()
